The map data in inst/extdata are derived from:

  BGS Geology 625k (DiGMapGB-625), bedrock and superficial deposits,
  version 5. https://www.bgs.ac.uk/datasets/bgs-geology-625k-digmapgb/

  BGS Seabed Sediments 250k (DiGSBS250k), version 3.
  https://www.bgs.ac.uk/datasets/seabed-sediments-250k/

Contains British Geological Survey materials (c) UKRI. The data are
released under the Open Government Licence v3.0:
https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/

The data have been re-encoded: coordinates are rounded to 5 m on the
British National Grid, the seabed map is reprojected from WGS 84, and only
the attributes that this package reports are kept. data-raw/build-layers.R
in the source repository records each step.

This package is not affiliated with or endorsed by the British Geological
Survey.
